# Release signing material never belongs in source control. The production
# key's passwords live in production-signing.properties outside the repository
# (ADR-076 D5), and the deleted beta flavor read its own from
# beta-signing.properties; a stray copy of either stays ignored here.
production-signing.properties
beta-signing.properties
*.p12
*.pfx
/signing/
